  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/idw-skill (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13/ and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated script, math_init.js. Both the hook and the payload are obfuscated with a large encoded string array and a custom decoder, so the payload's logic is hidden at install time. The package also declares a dependency on @or-sdk/base, a package in the same namespace. Installing this package triggers the download of a runtime and the execution of an opaque, obfuscated install-time payload.",
